			</svg>
			<span class="hidden sm:inline-block absolute right-full mr-3.5 bg-[#2D3137] text-white text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg shadow-xl whitespace-nowrap opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity pointer-events-none border border-white/10">
				¡Escríbenos por WhatsApp!
			</span>
		</a>
	</body>
</html>
